#. module: l10n_la
#: model:ir.module.module,description:base.module_l10n_la
msgid ""
"\n"
"Chart of Accounts for Laos.\n"
"===========================\n"
"\n"
"Chart of accounts for non-public-interest entities, as set by the Ministry of Finance\n"
"Decision No. 0369 of 4 February 2020.\n"
msgstr ""
"\n"
"ຜັງບັນຊີ ສຳລັບ ສປປ ລາວ.\n"
"===========================\n"
"\n"
"ຜັງບັນຊີ ສຳລັບ ຫົວໜ່ວຍທີ່ບໍ່ມີຜົນປະໂຫຍດຕໍ່ສາທາລະນະ, ຕາມທີ່ກຳນົດໄວ້ໂດຍ ກະຊວງການເງິນ\n"
"ຂໍ້ຕົກລົງ ເລກທີ 0369/ກງ, ລົງວັນທີ 4 ກຸມພາ 2020.\n"

#. module: l10n_la
#: model:ir.model,name:l10n_la.model_account_chart_template
msgid "Account Chart Template"
msgstr "ແມ່ແບບຜັງບັນຊີ"

#. module: l10n_la
#: model_terms:res.company,invoice_terms_html:l10n_la.demo_company_la
msgid ""
"All our contractual relations will be governed exclusively by Laos law."
msgstr ""
"ສາຍພົວພັນຕາມສັນຍາທັງໝົດຂອງພວກເຮົາ ຈະຖືກຄຸ້ມຄອງພາຍໃຕ້ກົດໝາຍຂອງ ສປປ ລາວ ເທົ່ານັ້ນ."

#. module: l10n_la
#: model_terms:res.company,invoice_terms_html:l10n_la.demo_company_la
msgid ""
"Below text serves as a suggestion and doesn’t engage Odoo S.A. "
"responsibility."
msgstr ""
"ຂໍ້ຄວາມລຸ່ມນີ້ເປັນພຽງຂໍ້ແນະນຳ ແລະ ບໍ່ມີຜົນຜູກມັດຄວາມຮັບຜິດຊອບຂອງ Odoo S.A."

#. module: l10n_la
#. odoo-python
#: code:addons/l10n_la/models/template_la.py:0
msgid "Cash"
msgstr "ເງິນສົດ"

#. module: l10n_la
#: model_terms:res.company,invoice_terms_html:l10n_la.demo_company_la
msgid ""
"Certain countries apply withholding at source on the amount of invoices, in "
"accordance with their internal legislation. Any withholding at source will "
"be paid by the client to the tax authorities. Under no circumstances can LA "
"Company become involved in costs related to a country's legislation. The "
"amount of the invoice will therefore be due to LA Company in its entirety "
"and does not include any costs relating to the legislation of the country in"
" which the client is located."
msgstr ""
"ບາງປະເທດມີການຫັກພາສີ ນະ ບ່ອນຈ່າຍ ຈາກມູນຄ່າໃບແຈ້ງໜີ້ ຕາມກົດໝາຍພາຍໃນຂອງປະເທດນັ້ນໆ. ການຫັກພາສີ "
"ນະ ບ່ອນຈ່າຍ ໃດໆ ລູກຄ້າຈະຕ້ອງເປັນຜູ້ຊຳລະໃຫ້ແກ່ເຈົ້າໜ້າທີ່ສ່ວຍສາອາກອນ. ບໍລິສັດ LA ຈະບໍ່ມີສ່ວນກ່ຽວຂ້ອງກັບຄ່"
"າໃຊ້ຈ່າຍຕ່າງໆ ທີ່ເກີດຈາກກົດໝາຍຂອງປະເທດນັ້ນໆ ໃນທຸກກໍລະນີ. ດັ່ງນັ້ນ, ມູນຄ່າເຕັມຕາມໃບແຈ້ງໜີ້ ຈະຕ້ອງຈ່າຍໃ"
"ຫ້ແກ່ ບໍລິສັດ LA ທັງໝົດ ແລະ ບໍ່ລວມຄ່າໃຊ້ຈ່າຍໃດໆ ທີ່ກ່ຽວຂ້ອງກັບກົດໝາຍຂອງປະເທດທີ່ລູກຄ້າຕັ້ງຢູ່."

#. module: l10n_la
#: model:ir.module.module,summary:base.module_l10n_la
msgid "Chart of accounts, VAT taxes and monthly VAT return for Laos"
msgstr ""
"ຜັງບັນຊີ, ອາກອນມູນຄ່າເພີ່ມ ແລະ ການແຈ້ງມອບອາກອນມູນຄ່າເພີ່ມປະຈຳເດືອນ ສຳລັບ ສປປ ລາວ"

#. module: l10n_la
#: model:res.company,pay_later_label:l10n_la.demo_company_la
msgid "Confirm"
msgstr "ຢືນຢັນ"

#. module: l10n_la
#: model:res.company,free_order_label:l10n_la.demo_company_la
msgid "Confirm Order"
msgstr "ຢືນຢັນການສັ່ງຊື້"

#. module: l10n_la
#: model:ir.model.fields,field_description:l10n_la.field_account_chart_template__display_name
msgid "Display Name"
msgstr "ຊື່ສະແດງ"

#. module: l10n_la
#: model:ir.model.fields,field_description:l10n_la.field_account_chart_template__id
msgid "ID"
msgstr "ລະຫັດ"

#. module: l10n_la
#: model_terms:res.company,invoice_terms_html:l10n_la.demo_company_la
msgid ""
"If a payment is still outstanding more than sixty (60) days after the due "
"payment date, LA Company reserves the right to call on the services of a "
"debt recovery company. All legal expenses will be payable by the client."
msgstr ""
"ຖ້າການຊຳລະເງິນຍັງຄ້າງເກີນກວ່າ ຫົກສິບ (60) ວັນ ຫຼັງຈາກກຳນົດເວລາຊຳລະ, ບໍລິສັດ LA ຂໍສະຫງວນສິດໃນກາ"
"ນນຳໃຊ້ບໍລິການຂອງບໍລິສັດທວງໜີ້. ຄ່າໃຊ້ຈ່າຍທາງກົດໝາຍທັງໝົດ ແມ່ນລູກຄ້າເປັນຜູ້ຮັບຜິດຊອບ."

#. module: l10n_la
#: model_terms:res.company,invoice_terms_html:l10n_la.demo_company_la
msgid ""
"In order for it to be admissible, LA Company must be notified of any claim "
"by means of a letter sent by recorded delivery to its registered office "
"within 8 days of the delivery of the goods or the provision of the services."
msgstr ""
"ເພື່ອໃຫ້ມີຜົນບັງຄັບໃຊ້ໄດ້, ການຮຽກຮ້ອງໃດໆ ຈະຕ້ອງແຈ້ງໃຫ້ ບໍລິສັດ LA ຊາບ ໂດຍຜ່ານຈົດໝາຍລົງທະບຽນ ສົ່ງເຖິ"
"ງສຳນັກງານທີ່ໄດ້ຈົດທະບຽນ ພາຍໃນ 8 ວັນ ນັບແຕ່ມື້ສົ່ງມອບສິນຄ້າ ຫຼື ການໃຫ້ບໍລິການ."

#. module: l10n_la
#: model_terms:res.company,invoice_terms_html:l10n_la.demo_company_la
msgid ""
"LA Company undertakes to do its best to supply performant services in due "
"time in accordance with the agreed timeframes. However, none of its "
"obligations can be considered as being an obligation to achieve results. LA "
"Company cannot under any circumstances, be required by the client to appear "
"as a third party in the context of any claim for damages filed against the "
"client by an end consumer."
msgstr ""
"ບໍລິສັດ LA ໃຫ້ຄຳໝັ້ນສັນຍາວ່າ ຈະພະຍາຍາມຢ່າງສຸດຄວາມສາມາດ ເພື່ອໃຫ້ບໍລິການທີ່ມີປະສິດທິພາບ ແລະ ທັນເວລາ "
"ຕາມກຳນົດເວລາທີ່ໄດ້ຕົກລົງກັນ. ແນວໃດກໍຕາມ, ພັນທະຕ່າງໆ ບໍ່ອາດຖືວ່າເປັນພັນທະທີ່ຈະຕ້ອງຮັບປະກັນຜົນໄດ້ຮັບສະເ"
"ໝີໄປ. ລູກຄ້າບໍ່ສາມາດຮຽກຮ້ອງໃຫ້ ບໍລິສັດ LA ເຂົ້າຮ່ວມເປັນບຸກຄົນທີສາມ ໃນການຮຽກຮ້ອງຄ່າເສຍຫາຍໃດໆ ທີ່ຜູ້ຊົມ"
"ໃຊ້ສຸດທ້າຍຮ້ອງຟ້ອງຕໍ່ລູກຄ້າ ໃນທຸກກໍລະນີ."

#. module: l10n_la
#: model:ir.module.module,shortdesc:base.module_l10n_la
msgid "Laos - Accounting"
msgstr "ສປປ ລາວ - ລະບົບບັນຊີ"

#. module: l10n_la
#: model_terms:res.company,invoice_terms_html:l10n_la.demo_company_la
msgid ""
"Our invoices are payable within 21 working days, unless another payment "
"timeframe is indicated on either the invoice or the order. In the event of "
"non-payment by the due date, LA Company reserves the right to request a "
"fixed interest payment amounting to 10% of the sum remaining due. LA Company"
" will be authorized to suspend any provision of services without prior "
"warning in the event of late payment."
msgstr ""
"ໃບແຈ້ງໜີ້ຂອງພວກເຮົາ ຕ້ອງຊຳລະພາຍໃນ 21 ວັນລັດຖະການ, ເວັ້ນເສຍແຕ່ມີການກຳນົດເວລາຊຳລະອື່ນ ລະບຸໄວ້ໃນ"
"ໃບແຈ້ງໜີ້ ຫຼື ໃບສັ່ງຊື້. ໃນກໍລະນີທີ່ບໍ່ມີການຊຳລະຕາມກຳນົດ, ບໍລິສັດ LA ຂໍສະຫງວນສິດໃນການຮຽກເກັບດອກເບ້ຍຕາ"
"ຍໂຕ ໃນອັດຕາ 10% ຂອງຍອດເງິນທີ່ຍັງຄ້າງຊຳລະ. ບໍລິສັດ LA ມີສິດໂຈະການໃຫ້ບໍລິການຕ່າງໆ ໂດຍບໍ່ຕ້ອງແຈ້ງລ່ວ"
"ງໜ້າ ໃນກໍລະນີທີ່ມີການຊຳລະຊັກຊ້າ."

#. module: l10n_la
#: model:res.company,pay_now_label:l10n_la.demo_company_la
msgid "Pay now"
msgstr "ຊຳລະຕອນນີ້"

#. module: l10n_la
#: model_terms:res.company,invoice_terms_html:l10n_la.demo_company_la
msgid "STANDARD TERMS AND CONDITIONS OF SALE"
msgstr "ເງື່ອນໄຂ ແລະ ຂໍ້ກຳນົດມາດຕະຖານໃນການຂາຍ"

#. module: l10n_la
#: model_terms:res.company,sign_terms:l10n_la.demo_company_la
#: model_terms:res.company,sign_terms_html:l10n_la.demo_company_la
msgid "Terms &amp; Conditions"
msgstr "ຂໍ້ກຳນົດ &amp; ເງື່ອນໄຂ"

#. module: l10n_la
#: model_terms:res.company,invoice_terms_html:l10n_la.demo_company_la
msgid ""
"The client explicitly waives its own standard terms and conditions, even if "
"these were drawn up after these standard terms and conditions of sale. In "
"order to be valid, any derogation must be expressly agreed to in advance in "
"writing."
msgstr ""
"ລູກຄ້າສະຫຼະສິດໃນຂໍ້ກຳນົດ ແລະ ເງື່ອນໄຂມາດຕະຖານຂອງຕົນເອງຢ່າງຈະແຈ້ງ, ເຖິງແມ່ນວ່າຂໍ້ກຳນົດເຫຼົ່ານັ້ນຈະຖືກສ້"
"າງຂຶ້ນພາຍຫຼັງ ຂໍ້ກຳນົດ ແລະ ເງື່ອນໄຂມາດຕະຖານໃນການຂາຍນີ້ກໍຕາມ. ເພື່ອໃຫ້ມີຜົນບັງຄັບໃຊ້, ການຍົກເວັ້ນໃດໆ "
"ຈະຕ້ອງໄດ້ຮັບການເຫັນດີເປັນລາຍລັກອັກສອນລ່ວງໜ້າຢ່າງຈະແຈ້ງ."

#. module: l10n_la
#: model_terms:res.company,invoice_terms_html:l10n_la.demo_company_la
msgid "You should update this document to reflect your T&amp;C."
msgstr ""
"ທ່ານຄວນອັບເດດເອກະສານນີ້ ເພື່ອໃຫ້ສອດຄ່ອງກັບ ຂໍ້ກຳນົດ &amp; ເງື່ອນໄຂ ຂອງທ່ານ."

#. module: l10n_la
#: model_terms:res.company,sign_terms:l10n_la.demo_company_la
#: model_terms:res.company,sign_terms_html:l10n_la.demo_company_la
msgid "Your conditions..."
msgstr "ເງື່ອນໄຂຂອງທ່ານ..."
